 <html><body>Abyssal Celebrant Undrias:<br>
-The Shilen Temple is a cultural treasure, with a history of more than 2,000 years. In the days when our race lived underground, the Harnea of the Arachne race spun silver spider webs and protected the temple by spinning a curtain around it.<br>
-Here, all young Dark Elves undergo rites to receive Shilen's blessing before beginning their new lives as Dark Fighters or Dark Mystics.<br>
+The Dark Temple is a cultural treasure, with a history of more than 2,000 years. In the days when our race lived underground, the Harnea of the Arachne race spun silver spider webs and protected the temple by spinning a curtain around it.<br>
+Here, all young Dark Elves undergo rites before beginning their new lives as Dark Fighters or Dark Mystics.<br>
 <a action="bypass -h npc_%objectId%_Chat 0">Return</a>
 </body></html>
