 <html><body>Daichir, Priest of the Earth:<br>
-Abundance! Prosperity! These are what the Goddess brings forth. Trust! Then you will be blessed! This is the sanctuary of <font color="LEVEL">Maphr, Goddess of Earth.</font><br>
-Your talent and ability are gifts from the Goddess. Your success and fame too are her blessings. Sacrifice! And be thankful. Although you are in adversity, do not hold a grudge or be sad. Everything is as the Goddess means it to be. Trust, then you will receive! Receive what? Blessings!<br>
-Do not forget that the Goddess of Earth is always around you and you should return her favor. Try hard. The Goddess is always watching over us. Just believe and follow her. Everything is as the Goddess means it to be.<br>
-Repeat this deep down in your heart if you want her blessing! <font color="LEVEL">Carna Maphra,</font> must not be forgotten. This is the holy name of the Goddess. <font color="LEVEL">Carna Maphra.</font><br>
+Abundance! Prosperity! Trust! Then you will be blessed! This is <font color="LEVEL">the sanctuary.</font><br>
+Your talent and ability are noted. Your success and fame are too. And be thankful. Although you are in adversity, do not hold a grudge or be sad. Everything is as its meant to be. Trust, then you will receive! Receive what? Blessings!<br>
+Try hard. Everything is as it is meant to be.<br>
+Repeat this deep down in your heart!<br>
 <a action="bypass -h npc_%objectId%_Quest">Quest</a>
 </body></html>
