-Hear, young Orc!! Let me explain the origin of our race! In the beginning, there was Pa'agrio of the flame, and from the hot flame Pa'agrio brought forth the the father of the Orcs. His hair was a red blaze, his eyes a pure white flame, ashen smoke rushed out of his nose and mouth as he breathed, and in his veins boiled blood hotter than lava! Because of all this, he was mightier than any other living thing!<br>
